<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    English translations.

    Mirror of res/values/strings.xml. Every key added to the Russian
    file MUST be added here too — otherwise the app falls back to
    the Russian version for the missing key (which is fine for graceful
    degradation, but obviously undesirable for a polished UI).

    Conventions:
      - Same `<name>` as values/strings.xml
      - English copy: concise, D&D-flavoured where applicable
      - Universal abbreviations (PHB, XGE, V/S/M, d4) stay as-is
      - Punctuation: prefer en-dashes (—) and curly quotes (“ ”) over
        ASCII variants where they read more naturally
-->
